'''Red''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from the [[Rainbow Box]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is bright red in color, hence the name. The guard is mahogany red, and the handle is solid black.

